relaunchNotice:
Hello {{display_name}},

A new era has begun at OpenThrone and development is active again. Read the news: {{newsLink}}

We would love to see you again. Log in before {{deletionDate}} to keep your account: {{loginLink}}

If you do not, we will erase your email address and your personal data. We keep only a one-way fingerprint of them so we can recognise you if you return: register again with the same email within two years, confirm the link we send to that address, and you will receive the Era 1 Tester title, get your original join date back, and may reclaim your old display name.

Prefer a clean break? Erase your account now: {{deleteLink}}

